  "title": "Harnessing AI in Physical Therapy Practices Today",
  "summary": "This blog explores how AI is helping physical therapy (PT) practices combat rising costs, falling reimbursements, and workforce burnout. As industry consolidation and admin burdens grow, AI tools like automated billing, denial management, and ambient scribing offer relief and boost efficiency. With the right tech, PT practices can improve care access, retain staff, and stay financially strong in a challenging healthcare landscape.",
